;; Reference answers for LLM-as-judge (UE set + website goldens appended 118).
{"wg-events-02-query-params-org" {:reference-answer "The GET /app/{org}/{app} endpoint accepts these query parameters: the ID of the event last retrieved (string) – the result set includes events registered after the provided event ID in chronological order; the lower limit for when the cloud event was registered in UTC (string date-time); the upper limit for when the cloud event was registered in UTC (string date-time); the party ID representing the subject of the cloud event; the organisation number representing the unit in the cloud event's alternative subject; the person number representing the person in the cloud event's alternative subject; the event types to include (array of string); and the size of the result set (string), with a default size of 50 events."}, "wg-tech-07-maskinporten-client-setup" {:reference-answer "Maskinporten-klienter opprettes i selvbetjeningsportalen (produksjon fra https://sjolvbetjening.samarbeid.digdir.no og test fra https://sjolvbetjening.test.samarbeid.digdir.no). Stegene er: 1) Logg inn på kontoen din med valgt metode. 2) Når du er logget inn vises organisasjonen du representerer i toppmenyen til høyre (representerer du en syntetisk organisasjon kan du endre den i nedtrekksmenyen). 3) Velg `Opprett klient`-knappen for å begynne å opprette en ny klient for organisasjonen du representerer. 4) Velg `Maskinporten` på `Legg til klient`-siden. 5) På `Legg til Maskinporten klient`-siden fyll inn visningsnavn, beskrivelse og legg til nødvendige scopes (verdiene kan endres senere), og klikk `Opprett`-knappen. 6) Klienten er nå opprettet; for å bruke den må du legge til minst én autentiseringsnøkkel (klienten støtter JWK- og PEM-nøkler) ved å finne eller opprette en nøkkel (f.eks. med Altinn JWKS-verktøyet), navigere til nøkkelseksjonen, velge `Legg til`, lime inn din offentlige nøkkel i feltet `JWK eller PEM format` og klikke `Lagre` (lagre den private nøkkelen sikkert; ved Azure Key Vault må private nøkler base64-kodes før opplasting). 7) Hvis du ikke gjorde det i trinn 5, må du legge til ønskede scopes til klienten før den kan brukes."}, "wg-broker-07-soap-transition-steps-en" {:reference-answer "There are three steps: Step 1 initiate the file transfer with an InitiateBrokerServiceBasic call (which returns a broker service/reference id); Step 2 upload the file using StreamedPayloadBasicBE (the response confirms the upload was successful and recipients can now download); Step 3 as the sender, make a GetAvailableFilesBasic request for files belonging to the recipient with FileStatus \"Uploaded\". If the file does not appear there, or in the list returned when repeating step 3 with FileStatus \"Downloaded\", it means the file failed during processing."}, "wg-notif-04-instant-sms-felter" {:reference-answer "For å sende en umiddelbar SMS gjør du en POST til /future/orders/instant/sms med disse feltene: idempotencyId (påkrevd) – en unik identifikator for sendingen som sikrer at samme melding ikke sendes flere ganger; sendersReference (valgfri) – din egen referanse som brukes til logging og sporing; phoneNumber (påkrevd) – mottakers telefonnummer i internasjonalt format med landskode; timeToLiveInSeconds (påkrevd) – levetid for meldingen i sekunder; sender (valgfri) – avsenderidentifikator som vises på mottakers telefon; og body (påkrevd) – innholdet i SMS-meldingen."}, "wg-dialog-06-fce-allowed-tags" {:reference-answer "De tillatte HTML-taggene for FCE-innhold er: <p> (avsnitt), <em> (kursiv/vektlegging), <strong> (fet/sterk vektlegging), <ul>/<ol>/<li> (lister), <a> (lenker), <code> (innebygd kode), <pre><code> (kodeblokker), <blockquote> (sitater), <hr> (horisontal linje/separator), <h1>–<h6> (overskrifter) og <br> (linjeskift). Attributter som forårsaker skriptutførelse er ikke tillatt og må fjernes."}, "wg-broker-09-news-enhancements-nb" {:reference-answer "De fremhevede forbedringene er: støtte for virkelig store filer (overføring av filer større enn 2 GB, opp til 100 GB og mer); GUI for konfigurering (GUI i Altinn Studio for konfigurering av ressurser i Altinn Formidling); og klient-GUI (GUI i Altinn Studio for opplasting og nedlasting av filer, som et alternativ til andre sluttbrukersystemer)."}, "wg-security-03-privacy-considerations" {:reference-answer "Consideration is given to the registered individual's right to privacy by: limitation of purpose; data minimization; disclosure of personal data in registers only to entities with a lawful basis for processing; protection of personal data; and limited scope of personal data in logs."}, "wg-api-01-instances-query-params-en" {:reference-answer "The instances endpoint supports these query parameters: org (string), appid (string), process.currentTask (string), process.isComplete (bool), process.endEvent (string, deprecated), process.ended (datetime), instanceOwner.partyId (int), lastChanged (datetime), created (datetime), visibleAfter (datetime), dueBefore (datetime), excludeConfirmedBy (string), status.isArchived (bool), size (int), mainVersionInclude (int), mainVersionExclude (int), status.isSoftDeleted (bool), and status.isHardDeleted (bool). There is also a header input parameter, X-Ai-InstanceOwnerIdentifier (string), to filter on person/organisation number."}, "ue-notif-06-egendefinert-avsender-epost-dns" {:reference-answer "Du setter en egen e-postavsender ved å inkludere feltet `senderEmailAddress` i `emailSettings`-objektet i API-kallet når du bestiller varsler. For å ta i bruk et eget domene som avsenderadresse må domenet først gjennom en registrerings- og verifiseringsprosess: (1) tjenesteeier ber om registrering av domene/avsender, (2) Digdir registrerer domenet og utsteder verifiseringsnøkler, (3) tjenesteeier legger til DNS-poster (TXT, SPF, DKIM, DMARC), (4) Digdir verifiserer DNS-postene og kobler domenet, og (5) tjenesteeier kan bruke domenet i API-kall."}, "ue-studio-01-skjul-felt-uttrykk" {:recall20-zero? true, :needs-review true, :note "Golden walks through a logikkregel built from underuttrykk; its worked example uses an OG/AND combination of (alder < 18) and (alder tomt). Query asks for tomt OR under 18 — confirm the intended boolean operator (ELLER) when reviewing.", :reference-answer "I Altinn Studio lager du en logikkregel på «Send inn»-knappen og velger «Skjul felt dersom». Du bygger uttrykket med underuttrykk: ett underuttrykk der Første operand er datamodellfeltet `alder`, Operator er «er mindre enn» og Andre operand er tallet 18, og et annet underuttrykk som sjekker om feltet er tomt, koblet sammen med ELLER slik at knappen skjules hvis enten feltet er tomt eller verdien er under 18. Lagre underuttrykkene; knappen skjules når uttrykket evalueres til sant."}, "wg-dialog-08-write-actions-constraints" {:reference-answer "Browser-based end-user systems implementing GUI actions are by default constrained to read operations, i.e. navigating to a page or downloading a file, using HTTP GET methods. While cross-origin full-page navigation is not constrained by browsers (enabling SSO and session initialization via redirects), performing a cross-origin POST (submitting a form to an endpoint on a different server) while relying on the same SSO and session initialization mechanisms is not possible in modern browsers or in ID-porten. This is by design, to avoid security issues stemming from cross-site request forgery (CSRF). Custom end-user systems using API actions and Maskinporten or system-user authentication are not constrained by this, since these are browser security measures and not inherent HTTP limitations."}, "wg-studio-06-options-ways-to-add" {:reference-answer "Options can be added in three ways: (1) Manually using the options property - select \"Manuelt\", click \"Legg til flere\", and provide a label and value for each option; (2) From a code list using optionsId - a predefined list referenced by a code list ID, optionally with secure set to true for secured dynamic code lists; and (3) From form data within the app using source, which links the component to a code list based on a repeating group in the data model (with group, label, value, description and helpText)."}, "wg-tech-06-cosmos-backup-collections" {:reference-answer "The following collections have an Azure Function that takes backup (using the Cosmos DB change feed, copying changed documents to a shared blob storage with soft delete enabled, retaining versions for 90 days): Applications, DataElements, InstanceEvents, Instance, and Texts."}, "ue-studio-03-datamodell-filer" {:reference-answer "En app-datamodell har fire modellfiler, lagret i repoet under `App/models`: C#-datamodellen (`<model>.cs`, brukt av backend/API-er), JSON schema (`<model>.schema.json`, brukt på frontend for fortløpende validering og i datamodelleringsverktøyet), XSD (`<model>.XSD`, XML-format som kan lastes opp/ned for å generere de andre filene), og JSON-metadata (`<model>.metadata.json`, brukt av Altinn Studio for å generere `.cs`-filen; lagres ikke i appen og genereres ved behov)."}, "wg-notif-01-sms-special-chars" {:reference-answer "When the system calculates message length using URL-encoded length, the following types of characters can affect the actual length of the message: national special characters such as Æ, Ø, Å and other national special characters; emojis and other special symbols; and line breaks and other control characters."}, "ue-dialog-04-activity-entity-fields" {:reference-answer "A Dialogporten activity is an immutable timeline entry that contains: `id`, `createdAt`, `type`, an optional `extendedType`, an optional `transmissionId`, `performedBy`, and `description` (which is only populated for `Information` activities). Yes — an activity can be tied to a specific transmission via the optional `transmissionId` field."}, "wg-tech-04-cli-commands" {:reference-answer "The documented commands are: the Application command, used to interact with application instances, whose GetInstances subcommand downloads all application instances (regardless of state) and stores them in the configured StorageOutputFolder; the Batch command, which lets you interact with an application by providing batches of data, with the CreateInstancesA2 subcommand instantiating a batch of instances based on the Altinn 2 xml schema; and the Storage command, used to fetch and upload instance data, which has a GetData subcommand (fetches data elements from Storage, with filter criteria or for a specific owner and instance) and a GetInstance subcommand (fetches the metadata of an instance from Platform Storage, with an optional savetofile option to store the instance object to a json-file in the configured StorageOutputFolder rather than writing it to the console)."}, "wg-corr-04-a2-a3-differences" {:reference-answer "Key differences between Altinn 2 and Altinn 3 Correspondence: the data model is largely the same to enable mapping/migration, but the MessageSummary field now supports only plain text (no HTML), ReplyOptions are simplified to URL + descriptive text, and MessageBody must now be in Markdown (HTML no longer supported). Attachments are uploaded streamed in a separate step before creating the correspondence and can be shared across multiple messages. The API supports mass sending using templates/keywords and recipient lists plus shared attachments, allowing one request with a list of recipients to create up to 200 correspondences. Notification templates are greatly simplified to a predefined set representing majority use (with one highly customizable one); advanced needs should integrate directly with Altinn-Notifications. The process is more asynchronous and publishes Altinn-Events at important process steps so systems don't need to poll. All correspondences are created in Dialogporten and thus available to Arbeidsflate and other integrating systems automatically. The authorization model is simplified: the right to be a sender can be set in the policy for the Write action (no longer limited to the service owner), and recipient rights are simplified from Altinn 2's Read/Write/ArchiveRead/ArchiveDelete to only Read. Archiving is not currently supported; the closest equivalent is the SystemLabel archive in Dialogporten/Arbeidsflate."}, "wg-tech-01-datatype-properties" {:reference-answer "The DataType model represents data requirements for an application for different process tasks. Its properties are: id (string, required, the id of the data type); description (LanguageString[], a short description with language support); allowedContentTypes (string[], a list of allowed content types); allowedContributers (string[], a list of allowed contributers on the format '{keyword}:{value}', approved keywords being org and orgno); taskId (string, required, the associated task from the process definition that defines the data required to progress to the next task); appLogic (ApplicationLogic, data object connecting data to application models, which should be null for data types describing attachments); maxSize (int, maximum allowed size of a data item of this type, undefined meaning unbounded); maxCount (int, maximum allowed data item count of this type, zero or below indicating unbounded); and minCount (int, minimum number of data items of this type, zero or below indicating the data type is optional)."}, "wg-authz-11-client-system-key-differences-en" {:reference-answer "For a system user for a client system: only vendor-controlled creation is possible; you can only specify required access via accessPackages, not rights (the rights list must be empty or omitted); and after approval an additional manual step is required, where the end-user must log in to Altinn and delegate the clients to the newly created system user."}, "wg-authz-01-client-admin-api-operations" {:reference-answer "The API lets you: (1) add new users in the organisation; (2) give users client rights for a client by delegating access packages; and (3) list users with rights for a client. To use the API you must be signed in as client administrator for the service provider (via an ID-porten client whose token is exchanged for an Altinn token)."}, "wg-studio-02-sideinnstillinger" {:reference-answer "pages-objektet i Settings.json støtter følgende innstillinger: hideCloseButton (Boolean) - om tilbake-til-innboks-knappen øverst i venstre hjørne skal skjules; showLanguageSelector (Boolean) - om språkvelgeren skal vises slik at brukeren kan bytte språk etter at skjemaet er åpnet; showExpandWidthButton (Boolean) - om utvid-bredde-knappen skal vises slik at brukeren kan utvide siden til å fylle hele nettleservinduet; showProgress (Boolean) - viser en fremdriftsindikator; pdfLayoutName (String) - egendefinert PDF-konfigurasjon; order (Array) - rekkefølgen på sider/oppgaver i en sidemeny; groups (Array) - gruppere sider; excludeFromPdf (Array) - sider som utelates fra PDF; og expandedWidth (Boolean) - utvidet skjemabredde."}, "ue-authz-06-xacml-obligation-authlevel" {:reference-answer "You set the required authentication level as an Obligation in the XACML policy file, using an `ObligationExpression` with an `AttributeAssignmentExpression` for the category `urn:altinn:minimum-authenticationlevel` and an integer value. The default required authentication level is 2. If you set it to 4, you must also allow the service owner to interact through level-3 authentication, because Maskinporten is defined as level 3."}, "wg-corr-02-varsling-tidspunkt" {:reference-answer "A notification is sent 5 minutes after the message's publication time (or 5 minutes after the current time if the publication time is in the past). If a reminder is activated, it is sent after 7 days if the message has not been read (in the test and staging environments the reminder is currently sent after 1 day). Notifications can be sent via email or SMS: email has no time window, but SMS notifications are only sent between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM — if the send time falls outside that window, the SMS is sent the following day."}, "wg-corr-08-what-you-get" {:reference-answer "Altinn Correspondence offers these unique benefits: Centralized communication (a central hub where all communications with public authorities can be managed from one account, eliminating the need for multiple accounts or platforms); Security and confidentiality (can be used for transferring sensitive information, using strong authentication and encryption to protect user data); Automation of submissions (allows automating submissions such as tax returns and annual accounts, saving time and reducing errors); Availability (Altinn is available around the clock, allowing submitting and receiving documents at any time); Integration with other systems (designed to easily integrate with other systems in both private and public sectors for seamless data flow); and Environmentally friendly (reduces the need for paper-based communication)."}, "wg-studio-21-eformidling-metadata" {:reference-answer "It is the application developer's responsibility to create the shipment message. To do so, create a class that implements the IEFormidlingMetadata interface and builds your message in the GenerateEFormidlingMetadata method (which returns a tuple of the metadata filename and a Stream), replacing YourMessageType and yourMessage with your shipment message type. Remember to register the class in Program.cs. The documentation provides an example using the arkivmelding message type (based on arkivmelding.xsd), which only includes the required parts of the arkivmelding; the message is serialized to XML with application/xml content type."}, "wg-authz-16-accessmanagement-rights-sources-nb" {:reference-answer "Responsen inneholder alle rettigheter for relevante relasjoner: rettigheter fra policy definert av tjenesteeier (f.eks. ER-roller eller Altinn-roller), og rettigheter fra delegerte policyer."}, "wg-dialog-09-json-patch-operations" {:reference-answer "Dialogporten støtter RFC 6902 JSON Patch. Patch-eksempelet setter status (replace /status til Completed), oppdaterer dialogsammendraget (replace /content/summary/value/1/value), fjerner alle GUI-handlinger (replace /guiActions til en tom liste) og legger til et vedlegg (add /attachments/-). Begrensning: listene over forsendelser og aktiviteter er uforanderlige, så replace- og remove-operasjoner aksepteres ikke på disse egenskapene. Lokaliseringer (f.eks. /content/summary) sorteres leksikografisk etter languageCode, slik at rekkefølgen alltid blir en, nb, nn, og indeks 1 alltid peker på nb."}, "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list" {:reference-answer "Fetch a single instance's metadata with the Get instance endpoint: `GET {org}/{appname}/instances/{instanceOwnerPartyId}/{instanceGuid}`, which returns the instance metadata document for that specific instance. The app API has no endpoint for listing instances; to list or query instances you must use the Storage API in the Platform, which has a query endpoint for that purpose."}, "wg-studio-05-options-text-properties" {:reference-answer "An option can have these text properties: label (the text displayed to the user), value (the value stored in the data model), description, and helpText. Both label and value are required properties for an option. The description and helpText properties provide additional information and can be displayed by the RadioButtons and Checkboxes components. Labels, descriptions and help texts can be plain text or a key pointing to a text resource (and can be dynamic expressions when options come from a repeating structure in the data model)."}, "wg-authz-06-systemregister-fields-nb" {:reference-answer "JSON-nyttelasten må definere: id (unik identifikator på formatet {systemleverandørorgnr}_{valgt navn}); vendor (organisasjonsnummeret til systemleverandøren, ID satt til 0192:{orgnr}); name og description (synlige tekster, oppgitt for nb, nn og en); rights (individuelle ressurser, f.eks. urn:altinn:resource) og/eller accessPackages (forhåndsdefinerte tilgangspakker); clientId (liste med klient-ID-er som UUID-er fra Maskinporten); isVisible (true/false for synlighet i portalen); og allowedredirecturls (valgfri liste med godkjente omdirigerings-URL-er, kan utelates eller settes som tom liste)."}, "wg-api-05-app-metadata-fields-nb" {:reference-answer "Applikasjonens metadata-modell inneholder feltene: id, versionId, org, title, validFrom, validTo, processId, dataTypes, partyTypesAllowed, autoDeleteOnProcessEnd, presentationFields, dataFields, eFormidling og messageBoxConfig."}, "wg-api-03-instance-model-fields-en" {:reference-answer "The Instance model contains these fields: id, instanceOwner, appId, org, selfLinks, dueBefore, visibleAfter, process, status, completeConfirmations, data, presentationTexts, dataValues, created, createdBy, lastChanged, and lastChangedBy."}, "wg-community-03-exception-api-status-codes" {:reference-answer "Exceptions handled by application logic can result in: 200 - Ok (the original request is considered successfully processed); 400 - BadRequest (the exception was caused by a faulty request, though active validation is preferred over relying on an exception); 401 - Unauthorized (similar to BadRequest but associated with authentication); 403 - Forbidden (similar to BadRequest but associated with authorization); and 404 - NotFound (the requested resource does not exist). Application logic should ideally never produce a 500 response; unhandled exceptions left to the default middleware always result in status code 500."}, "wg-corr-01-serviceowner-events" {:reference-answer "For service owners, Altinn Correspondence publishes these event types: no.altinn.correspondence.attachmentinitialized (attachment created and awaiting upload), attachmentpublished (attachment passed malware scanning and is ready for use), attachmentuploadfailed (attachment failed malware scanning), attachmentexpired (attachment expiration time has passed), correspondenceinitialized (correspondence initialized), correspondencepublished (correspondence published and available to the recipient), correspondencepurged (correspondence purged by recipient after publishing or by service owner before publishing), correspondencepublishfailed (correspondence publish failed), notificationcreated (notification order created in Altinn Notification), correspondencenotificationcreationfailed (creation of notification order failed), correspondencenotificationfailed (delivery to one or more notification addresses failed — partial failure), correspondencenotificationallfailed (delivery to all notification addresses failed), correspondencenotificationdelivered (initial notification confirmed delivered), and correspondencenotificationreminderdelivered (reminder notification confirmed delivered)."}, "wg-studio-01-page-settings-properties" {:reference-answer "The pages object in Settings.json supports the following settings: hideCloseButton (Boolean) - whether the back-to-inbox button in the upper left corner is hidden; showLanguageSelector (Boolean) - whether the language selector is visible so the user can switch language after opening the form; showExpandWidthButton (Boolean) - whether the expand-width button is visible so the user can expand the page to fill the browser window; showProgress (Boolean) - shows a progress indicator; pdfLayoutName (String) - custom PDF layout configuration; order (Array) - the order of pages/tasks in a side menu; groups (Array) - grouping pages; excludeFromPdf (Array) - pages excluded from the PDF; and expandedWidth (Boolean) - expanded form width."}, "wg-broker-03-event-types-by-role-en" {:reference-answer "For Senders the event types are: no.altinn.broker.filetransferinitialized, no.altinn.broker.uploadprocessing, no.altinn.broker.uploadfailed, no.altinn.broker.allconfirmeddownloaded, and no.altinn.broker.filepurged. For both Senders and Recipients the event types are: no.altinn.broker.published, no.altinn.broker.downloadconfirmed, and no.altinn.broker.fileneverconfirmeddownloaded."}, "wg-authz-07-systemregister-fields-en" {:reference-answer "The JSON payload must define: id (a unique identifier on the format {systemsupplier_orgnr}_{chosen_name}); vendor (the system supplier's organization number, with ID set to 0192:{orgnr}); name and description (visible texts provided for nb, nn and en); rights (individual resources, e.g. urn:altinn:resource) and/or accessPackages (predefined access packages); clientId (a list of client ID UUIDs generated in Maskinporten); isVisible (true/false for portal visibility); and allowedredirecturls (an optional list of exact approved redirect URLs, which can be omitted or set as an empty list)."}, "ue-authz-07-bruker-typer-authorization" {:reference-answer "Altinn Authorization supports four user types: Users, Organization, Service owner, and System user. Of these, Users (who can represent other parties through party selection) and System users (which impersonate the system user with rights delegated from the customer) can effectively act/submit on behalf of a party in an app. Organizations are not valid submitters (an organization cannot submit on behalf of itself), and Service owners are also not valid submitters, though depending on the XACML policy they can start new instances and modify data in existing ones."}, "wg-studio-10-footer-komponenter" {:reference-answer "Bunnteksten støtter fire komponenttyper: Email (egenskaper: type, title, target = e-postadressen), Phone (type, title, target = telefonnummeret), Link (type, title, target = URLen, og icon som er en av information, email eller phone) og Text (type og title; title for Text støtter formattering, mens title for Email, Phone og Link ikke gjør det). Bunnteksten defineres i App/ui/footer.json, og nye komponenter legges til i footer-listen."}, "wg-security-02-privatlivsvern-mekanismer" {:reference-answer "Med utgangspunkt i rettspraksis kan relevante elementer være: forholdsmessighet; og rettsikkerhetsmekanismer som gjør et inngrep mer forholdsmessig, herunder muligheten til å forutse sin rettsposisjon, muligheten til å klage, mulighet til å stanse den problematiske databehandlingen (herunder hvorvidt Datatilsynet kan pålegge en stans), samt tilgang til domstol."}, "ue-authz-04-opprette-tilgangsliste-medlemmer" {:reference-answer "Opprett først listen med `PUT /access-lists/{owner}/{identifier}`, der `owner` er organisasjonskoden og `identifier` er en valgt ID, med en payload som inneholder `name` og `description`. Legg deretter til organisasjoner som medlemmer med `POST /access-lists/{owner}/{identifier}/members`, ett medlem om gangen, der medlemmet identifiseres i `data`-feltet, f.eks. `urn:altinn:organization:identifier-no:123456789`."}, "wg-dialog-11-migration-status" {:reference-answer "Alle nye meldinger opprettet i Altinn 3 Melding er tilgjengelige i Dialogporten umiddelbart (ingen migrering nødvendig). Nye app-instanser opprettet i Altinn 3 er tilgjengelige umiddelbart og endringer synkroniseres i sanntid. For migrerte data er meldinger og skjema foreløpig migrert tilbake til 1. januar 2019, og eldre app-instanser/arkiverte skjema vil bli migrert senere. Nylig arkiverte app-instanser opprettet i Altinn 2 migreres i puljer hvert 5. minutt, og skjema som er under utfylling blir ikke migrert før de er arkivert."}, "wg-api-06-systemregister-validation-errors-en" {:reference-answer "The endpoint can return these validation error codes (all with status 400): AUTH.VLD-00000 (the org number identifier is not valid ISO6523 identifier), AUTH.VLD-00001 (the system id does not match the format orgnumber_xxxx...), AUTH.VLD-00002 (the system id already exists), AUTH.VLD-00003 (one or all the resources in rights is not found in altinn's resource register), AUTH.VLD-00004 (one of the client id is already tagged with an existing system), AUTH.VLD-00005 (one or more of the redirect urls format is not valid), AUTH.VLD-00006 (one or more duplicate rights found), AUTH.VLD-00007 (one or more duplicate access package(s) found), AUTH.VLD-00008 (one or all the accesspackage(s) is not found in altinn's access packages or is not a part of REGN/REVI/Forretningsfører roller), and AUTH.VLD-00009 (one or more resource id is in wrong format)."}, "ue-events-01-abonnement-filtre" {:needs-review true, :note "Empty-typeFilter mechanism inferred from Altinn Events' exact-match filter semantics; verify against the full chunk (the clipped golden shows resourceFilter/subjectFilter but not the typeFilter empty-string note explicitly).", :reference-answer "Når du oppretter et abonnement i Altinn Events kan du sette `resourceFilter` (påkrevd; eksakt treff på ressursen, f.eks. `urn:altinn:resource:app_digdir_demoapp`, kan autofylles fra `source` for en gyldig Altinn Studio App-URL), `subjectFilter` (påkrevd med mindre du er tjenesteeier; eksakt treff på cloud-event-subjektet), samt valgfrie `sourceFilter`, `alternativeSubjectFilter` og `typeFilter`. Filtrene gjør et eksakt treff, så hvis du setter `typeFilter` til en tom streng matcher den ingen hendelsestype og du mottar ingen hendelser — utelat filteret hvis du ikke vil begrense på type."}, "ue-corr-04-notification-order-sms-window" {:reference-answer "An SMS notification is only sent within the SMS window of 09:00–17:00 (9 AM–5 PM); if the send time falls outside that window it is sent the following day (email has no time window). If a reminder is enabled and the message stays unread, the reminder is sent after 7 days in production — but after 1 day in the test/staging environment."}, "wg-community-04-v3-changelog" {:reference-answer "Version 3 introduced the following changes: a bug causing a 404 response when retrieving the rule configuration for an application while specifying the layout set id was fixed; a PDF copy is now generated for tasks completed by the application owner as well as the end user; all apps now expose an endpoint for getting the current page order based on the current state of an instance (overridable via FormatPdf in Logic/App.cs); 3.3.0 - retrieving a certificate from Key Vault now uses the certificate name instead of the certificate id; 3.2.3 - fixed a duplicate key exception thrown on options when the same option key was used; 3.2.1 - an instance now correctly appears as read in the messagebox when instantiated by an end user through the api; 3.2.0 - selected options are now displayed with their label rather than their value in the PDF; and 3.0.4 - Swagger support was added via Swashbuckle, generating interactive OpenAPI documentation available at https://[org].apps.altinn.no/[org]/[app]/swagger/index.html."}, "wg-api-02-instances-date-operators-nb" {:reference-answer "For filtrering på tid kan du bruke følgende operatorer: gt: (større enn), gte: (større eller lik), lt: (mindre enn), lte: (mindre enn eller lik) og eq: (lik, kan også være tom). Operatorene kan kombineres for å lage et intervall, for eksempel dueBefore=gt:2019-02&dueBefore=lt:2019-03-01."}, "ue-studio-02-pdf-service-task" {:recall20-zero? true, :needs-review true, :note "Authored from the golden (Arbeidsflyt-tab drag-and-drop PDF service task, standard vs custom). The agent answered from a different doc (service task + NuGet 8.9 + enablePdfGeneration); reviewer should decide whether the reference should also mention the 8.9 / enablePdfGeneration prerequisite.", :reference-answer "In Altinn Studio, open the Arbeidsflyt (process) tab and drag-and-drop a PDF service task into the process where you want the PDF generated (often right after a data task). A configuration panel then opens where you choose between a standard PDF (based on selected previous tasks, shown in summary mode — this does not respect the `pdfLayoutName` configuration in Settings.json) or a custom PDF. Altinn Studio inserts a `serviceTask` (id `Pdf`, name `PDF`) into `App/config/process/process.bpmn`."}, "wg-authz-09-vendor-request-prerequisites-nb" {:reference-answer "Før du initierer den leverandørstyrte forespørselen må du: kjenne organisasjonsnummeret (partyOrgNo) til sluttbrukerkunden; ha definert hvilke tilgangspakker (accessPackages) eller enkeltrettigheter (rights) systembrukeren trenger; (valgfritt) ha forhåndsregistrert redirectUrl-en på systemet ditt dersom den skal benyttes; og (valgfritt) kunne sette integrationTitle hvis du ønsker et spesifikt navn på systembrukeren (ellers får den samme navn som systemet)."}, "ue-broker-05-filstorrelse-grenser-multi" {:reference-answer "I Altinn Broker er standardgrensen 2 GB med virusskanning, og denne grensen skyldes nettopp begrensninger i virusskanningen. Uten virusskanning støttes langt større filer — opptil ca. 1600 GB (1,6 TB er den teoretiske maksgrensen, men det benchmarkes jevnlig bare til 100 GB). For å sende filer større enn 2 GB må ressursen ha virusskanning deaktivert, og slike ressurser må forhåndsgodkjennes av Altinn (Digdir)."}, "ue-studio-07-validering-uttrykk-fil" {:reference-answer "Validering med uttrykk kan foreløpig ikke konfigureres i Altinn Studio Designer, så du oppretter en egen fil ved siden av datamodellen med navnekonvensjonen `navn.validation.json` (f.eks. `skjema.validation.json` hvis datamodellen heter `skjema`), med `$schema`, `validations` og `definitions`. Reglene legges i `validations`-objektet der datamodell-stien (samme format som `dataModelBindings`) er nøkkelen og verdien er en liste med regler; hver regel har `message`, `severity` og en `condition` som er et dynamisk uttrykk som returnerer sant når feilen skal vises. Gjenbrukbare regler kan defineres under `definitions`."}, "wg-authz-08-systemuser-token-values-nb" {:reference-answer "Verdiene som er viktige for tjenesteeier er: authorization_details:systemuser_id (unik id for systembrukeren — den Altinn trenger for å autorisere tilgang, og som har fått delegert tilganger); authorization_details:systemuser_org:id (organisasjonen som har opprettet systembrukeren); authorization_details:system_id (referanse til systemet systembrukeren peker på); og Consumer:id (organisasjonsnummer til systemleverandøren som har autentisert seg mot Maskinporten)."}, "wg-events-02-query-responskoder" {:reference-answer "The Altinn Events GET /events query API can return four response codes: 200 OK – events matching the query set are returned; 400 Bad Request – an invalid set of query parameters (refer to the problem details in the response body for more information); 401 Unauthorized – a missing, invalid or expired authorization header; and 403 Forbidden – missing the required scope for subscribing to events."}, "wg-studio-04-maskinporten-settings-fields" {:reference-answer "MaskinportenSettings-objektet i App/appsettings.json består av tre felter: Authority (f.eks. \"https://test.maskinporten.no/\"), ClientId (klient-id-en) og JwkBase64 (en base64-kodet jwk)."}, "wg-apptmpl-02-app-process-components" {:reference-answer "Apps created in Altinn Studio have a separate Process API that exposes functionality to clients to control the process. The process service holds the business logic for BPMN processing and is responsible for verifying state and changes of state. The BPMN reader is the component that parses the BPMN process in apps. When the app process changes state, app logic is run, making it possible for app developers to implement specific app logic (see AppBase.cs and the IAltinnApp interface)."}, "wg-authz-10-vendor-request-prerequisites-en" {:reference-answer "Before initiating the vendor-controlled request you must: know the organization number (partyOrgNo) of the end-user customer; have defined which access packages (accessPackages) or individual rights (rights) the system user needs; (optionally) have pre-registered the redirectUrl in your system if it is to be used; and (optionally) set integrationTitle if you want a specific name for the system user (otherwise it gets the same name as the system)."}, "wg-api-07-systemregister-validation-errors-nb" {:reference-answer "Endepunktet kan returnere disse valideringsfeilkodene (alle med statuskode 400): AUTH.VLD-00000 (the org number identifier is not valid ISO6523 identifier), AUTH.VLD-00001 (the system id does not match the format orgnumber_xxxx...), AUTH.VLD-00002 (the system id already exists), AUTH.VLD-00003 (one or all the resources in rights is not found in altinn's resource register), AUTH.VLD-00004 (one of the client id is already tagged with an existing system), AUTH.VLD-00005 (one or more of the redirect urls format is not valid), AUTH.VLD-00006 (one or more duplicate rights found), AUTH.VLD-00007 (one or more duplicate access package(s) found) og AUTH.VLD-00008 (one or all the accesspackage(s) is not found in altinn's access packages or is not a part of REGN/REVI/Forretningsfører roller)."}, "wg-notif-01-ordrestatus-verdier" {:reference-answer "En varslingsordre i Altinn Notifications kan ha seks OrderProcessingState-verdier (API-statusstreng i parentes):\n1. Registered (Order_Registered) – ordren er opprettet og lagret, men behandlingen har ikke startet ennå (midlertidig).\n2. Processing (Order_Processing) – ordren behandles nå (mottakeroppslag, evaluering av sendebetingelser osv.) (midlertidig).\n3. Processed (Order_Processed) – ordren er ferdig behandlet og overlevert til e-post- og SMS-kanalene (midlertidig).\n4. Completed (Order_Completed) – ordren er ferdig behandlet, og alle varsler har fått endelig leveringsstatus (endelig).\n5. SendConditionNotMet (Order_SendConditionNotMet) – sendebetingelsen var ikke oppfylt, derfor ble ingen varsler sendt (endelig).\n6. Cancelled (Order_Cancelled) – ordren ble kansellert før utsending (endelig).\nForskjellen på Processed og Completed: Processed betyr at alle varsler er opprettet men at sluttstatus for leveringen fortsatt følges opp, mens Completed betyr at både ordren og alle tilhørende varsler har fått endelig leveringsstatus."}, "wg-dialog-01-cloud-event-types" {:reference-answer "Hendelser produsert direkte av Dialogporten: dialogporten.dialog.created.v1 (ny dialog opprettet), dialogporten.dialog.updated.v1 (eksisterende dialog oppdatert), dialogporten.dialog.deleted.v1 (dialog slettet), dialogporten.dialog.restored.v1 (dialog gjenopprettet), dialogporten.dialog.seen.v1 (dialog sett/åpnet av en sluttbruker) og dialogporten.dialog.transmission.created.v1 (forsendelse opprettet). I tillegg sendes følgende hendelser ut når tjenesteeier oppdaterer aktivitetsloggen: dialogporten.dialog.activity.created.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.closed.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.information.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.transmission-opened.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.payment-made.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.signature-provided.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.dialog-opened.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.dialog-deleted.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.dialog-restored.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.sent-to-signing.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.sent-to-form-fill.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.sent-to-send-in.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.sent-to-payment.v1, dialogporten.dialog.activity.form-submitted.v1 og dialogporten.dialog.activity.form-saved.v1."}, "wg-corr-07-maskinporten-key-steps" {:reference-answer "A Maskinporten client supports JWK and PEM keys. To add an authentication key: locate an existing key or create a new one (you can use the Altinn JWKS tool or another key generator); navigate to the key section on your client page and select Add; in the JWK or PEM format field paste your public key and click Save. Store your private key in a secure location, as it is used to authorize use of the client. If you use Azure Key Vault to store private keys, they must be base64-encoded before uploading. You also need to add the desired scopes to the client before it can be used."}, "ue-authz-02-tilgangsliste-handlingsfilter" {:reference-answer "Bruk et handlingsfilter (`actionFilters`) når du kobler tilgangslisten til ressursen, via `PUT /access-lists/{owner}/{identifier}/resource-connections/{resourceIdentifier}`. Sett den ene listens `actionFilters` til kun `read` for lesetilgang, og den andres til `read` og `write` for lese- og skrivetilgang. En null eller tom `actionFilters` betyr at alle handlinger er tillatt, og handlingene må samsvare med handlingene i XACML-policyen."}, "wg-notif-03-instant-sms-fields" {:reference-answer "To send an instant SMS you POST to /future/orders/instant/sms with these fields: idempotencyId (required) – a unique identifier for the sending used to ensure the same message is not sent multiple times; sendersReference (optional) – your own reference used for logging and tracking; phoneNumber (required) – the recipient's phone number in international format with country code; timeToLiveInSeconds (required) – the time-to-live for the message in seconds; sender (optional) – the sender identifier displayed on the recipient's phone; and body (required) – the content of the SMS message."}, "wg-broker-06-transition-considerations-en" {:reference-answer "Key considerations: (1) Requests that can specify ServiceCode/ServiceEdition are immediately transferred to Altinn 3 via the Altinn 3 Broker Bridge; if SC/SE can be specified but aren't, requests are not transferred. (2) Requests that cannot specify SC/SE first query Altinn 2 Broker storage, and if nothing is found, a call is made to Altinn 3. (3) Files in Altinn 3 cannot be larger than 1 GB (the Altinn 2 maximum), so the Altinn 3 Resource should be configured with this max filesize restriction. (4) File data and metadata are stored in the Altinn 3 store while Altinn 2 just calls Altinn 3. (5) Receipts are no longer stored in Altinn 2; a pseudo receipt with receiptId 0 is generated from Altinn 3 metadata, so the Altinn 2 Receipt endpoint can no longer be used for Broker. (6) Use of the Manifest file in submitted file data is deprecated in Altinn 3, but Manifest-file functionality can be enabled in the transition solution."}, "ue-studio-05-tekstressurser-sprak" {:reference-answer "Du redigerer og oversetter tekster i Altinn Studio enten via Altinn Studio Designer eller direkte i repository. I Designer går du til Tekst i toppmenyen for å se og redigere tekstressurser; «Ny tekst» oppretter en ressurs med en automatisk generert tekstnøkkel (kan endres med blyant-ikonet), og endringer lagres automatisk. I panelet til høyre velger du hvilke språk som vises i tabellen og legger til nye språk appen skal oversettes til. Du kan også legge til/redigere/oversette tekster for en enkelt komponent direkte fra skjemaeditoren («Lage»-fanen)."}, "wg-studio-17-process-actions-bpmn" {:reference-answer "For å legge til handlinger på en oppgave endrer du filen App/config/process/process.bpmn og legger til ønskede handlinger inne i en altinn:actions-blokk under altinn:taskExtension i oppgaven (f.eks. <altinn:action>demo</altinn:action> og <altinn:action type=\"processAction\">custom</altinn:action>). type-attributtet processAction er standardverdien, så en handling uten oppgitt type er også processAction. I tillegg må brukerne gis rettigheter til å utføre handlingene, noe som defineres i policy.xml med en XACML-regel (Rule med Effect=\"Permit\") som matcher rolle, org, app, task og action-id."}, "wg-notif-05-error-not-00001-causes" {:reference-answer "NOT-00001 (HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity) means the API could not process the notification order because one or more recipients do not have the required contact information available for Altinn. The common causes are: the recipient has not registered an email address or phone number; the recipient has registered contact information, but it is not valid or verified; and for organizational recipients, the organization may not have registered contact details."}, "wg-authz-04-apischeme-policy-rule-roles-en" {:reference-answer "The policy must have a rule granting the APIADM role the right to the action scopeaccess (ScopeAccess). If the contact person for NUF should also be able to delegate, the APIADMNUF role must be added as well."}, "ue-studio-06-options-kilder-kodeliste" {:reference-answer "Du kobler en komponent til svaralternativer/kodelister med én av tre egenskaper: `options` (statiske svaralternativer definert per komponent), `optionsId` (statiske kodelister fra JSON-filer, dynamiske kodelister eller delte kodelister), eller `source` (kodelister fra datamodellen). Minst én må settes; hvis flere er satt er prioriteten motsatt av rekkefølgen over, slik at `source` har forrang over `optionsId`, som har forrang over `options`."}, "wg-corr-03-transmission-types" {:reference-answer "The valid transmission types and their numeric values are: Information (1), Acceptance (2), Rejection (3), Request (4), Alert (5), Decision (6), Submission (7), and Correction (8). Transmission type defaults to Information (1) if not set; it can be set by adding a DialogportenTransmissionType external reference when initializing the correspondence, using either the enum name or the numeric value."}, "wg-tech-05-appdeploy-pipeline-flags" {:reference-answer "The build and deploy app pipeline is controlled by these flags: APP_COMMIT_ID (used as the id for the app image and to reference the repository at that commit state); APP_DEPLOY_TOKEN (used to identify the user when cloning the repository, only really necessary for private repositories but mandatory); APP_ENVIRONMENT (represents which environment to deploy to, not yet used); APP_OWNER (the owner of the repository); APP_REPO (the name of the repository to clone and use to create the app); GITEA_ENVIRONMENT (the gitea environment to clone the repository from); should_build (flag to optionally only deploy and not build, default true); and should_deploy (flag to deploy an app, default false). The pipeline is triggered by the Deploy button in Altinn Studio."}, "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg" {:reference-answer "Aktivitetsloggen i Dialogporten er en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer som viser historikken gjennom en dialogs levetid, der hver oppføring er av en bestemt type (f.eks. opprettelse av dialogen, en melding fra tjenesteeier, innsendt data, en signatur eller betaling, eller at en forsendelse åpnes). Tjenesteeieren er ansvarlig for å fylle den ut, normalt i forbindelse med andre endringer i dialogen."}, "wg-broker-02-webhook-event-types-nb" {:reference-answer "Altinn 3 Formidling publiserer disse hendelsestypene: filetransferinitialized (informasjon om en ny filoverføring), filedeleted (filen har blitt slettet fra Altinn Formidling), fileneverconfirmeddownloaded (filen har ikke blitt bekreftet nedlastet av noen mottaker), uploadprocessing (filen har blitt opplastet og blir kontrollert), published (filen er ferdig opplastet og kontrollert, og er klar for nedlasting), uploadfailed (filopplasting eller kontroll feilet), downloadconfirmed (en eller flere mottakere har bekreftet vellykket nedlasting) og allconfirmeddownloaded (alle aktuelle mottakere har bekreftet vellykket nedlasting)."}, "wg-studio-07-custom-template-fields" {:reference-answer "The template.json file has these properties: schemaVersion (string, required) - which JSON Schema version the template follows, currently only 0.1 is supported; id (string, required) - unique ID for the template; owner (string, required) - owner of the template (organization short name); name (string, required) - name of the template; description (string, required) - description of the template; remove (array, optional) - list of relative file paths or globs to remove from the application repo; packageReferences (array, optional) - list of NuGet packages to add to specified .csproj files; and nextSteps (array, optional) - list of next steps to guide users after the template is applied."}, "wg-studio-13-multipage-group" {:reference-answer "To split a repeating group's fill-out over multiple pages, prefix each component in the children list with a number indicating which page it appears on, followed by a colon. The count starts at 0, so components on the first page are prefixed 0:, the second page 1:, and so on. In addition you must set \"multiPage\": true in the edit parameter. This functionality is only available for repeating groups and only for top-level groups (not nested groups); navigation happens within the layout and updates only the display inside the group's editing area. A mode such as hideTable can also be set to hide the table while editing."}, "wg-notif-08-api-base-urls" {:reference-answer "Base-URL-ene som svarer til hvert miljø for Altinn Varslinger API er: AT (privat Altinn akseptansetestmiljø): https://platform.{environment}.altinn.cloud/notifications/api/v1; TT02 (testmiljø for applikasjonseiere): https://platform.tt02.altinn.no/notifications/api/v1; og Production: https://platform.altinn.no/notifications/api/v1."}, "ue-api-06-app-openapi-swagger-spec" {:recall20-zero? true, :reference-answer "The app-specific OpenAPI/Swagger spec — the variant that includes the datamodel schemas for a given Altinn 3 app — is served in a browser at `{org}.apps.altinn.no/{org}/{app}/swagger`. From NuGet package version 8.6.0 onward there are two specs: a traditional autogenerated one (all APIs but no datatype info) and this app-specific one."}, "wg-security-04-etterretningsrisiko-tiltak" {:reference-answer "Mange av tiltakene som reduserer etterretningsrisiko er de samme som reduserer sikkerhetsrisiko, og Digdir nevner blant annet: kontroll på systemer og dataflyt, pseudonymisering, sletterutiner, tilgangsstyring og monitorering. I tillegg har Digdir sørget for kryptering av data under transport og kryptering av data ved stillstand/lagring, samt geografisk avgrensning til Norge og EU, herunder ved Microsofts implementering av EU Data Boundary og Customer Lockbox."}, "wg-notif-06-error-not-00002-aarsaker" {:reference-answer "NOT-00002 (HTTP-statuskode 499 Client Closed Request) betyr at klienten koblet fra eller kansellerte forespørselen før serveren kunne fullføre behandlingen. De vanlige årsakene er: timeout på klientsiden oppstod; nettverkstilkoblingen ble avbrutt; bruker kansellerte operasjonen; og applikasjonen avsluttet HTTP-forespørselen."}, "ue-studio-04-non-repeating-group" {:reference-answer "Group several fields by adding a Group component in `FormLayout.json` with `type` `Group` and a `children` array listing the component IDs you want together. Once grouped, you can apply the same dynamics to all of them at once instead of configuring each field individually. You can do this manually in the file or via the group component in the Altinn Studio form editor."}, "wg-api-10-resource-write-scope-en" {:reference-answer "Your organization needs the scope altinn:resourceregistry/resource.write to be allowed to create and modify your organization's resources and policies."}, "wg-security-05-data-locations" {:reference-answer "Altinn Studio (usernames, email addresses, organization affiliation, passwords, GitHub integration, source code) is in North Europe (to be moved to West Europe; not moved to Norway East due to lack of functionality there). In the Service Owner Clusters: Application Insights logging is in West Europe; Azure Key Vault (SAS definitions for Storage Account) in Norway East; Azure Key Vault (API keys/certificates uploaded by service owner) in Norway East; Azure Blob Storage (form data and binary attachments) in Norway East; Azure Container Registry (container images) in West Europe (not available in Norwegian data centers). In the Altinn Platform: Azure PostgreSQL (submission metadata and events) in Norway East; Azure Key Vault (platform secrets) in Norway East; Altinn Storage Account (policy files) in Norway East; Log Analytics Workspace/Application Insights (logs from applications, services, clusters) in West Europe; and Microsoft Entra ID (usernames, hashed passwords, phone numbers, names) in Europe, with some exceptions such as SMS."}, "wg-tech-08-logical-data-storage" {:reference-answer "The data objects are stored as follows: the metadata about data for an instance is stored in Cosmos DB in a shared collection (created by the storage component when data is added to an instance); the data itself (any structured or unstructured data the org receives or sends through the app, ranging from a few bytes to gigabytes, created by both end users and the application owner) is stored in Azure blob storage in an isolated storage for each org; app events (structured as cloud events, created by applications to support external consumption) are stored in PostgreSQL for 90 days; and texts used in an application (connected to a given app, created by the application developer) are stored in Cosmos DB in a shared collection."}, "ue-events-02-publisere-cloudevents" {:reference-answer "Du publiserer en egendefinert (generisk) hendelse med `POST /events`, med innholdstype `application/cloudevents+json` og en Cloud Event serialisert som en JSON-streng i request body. API-et krever autentisering og Maskinporten-scopet `altinn:events.publish`. Cloud Event-en må ha id, type, source (URI) og en `resource` i formatet `urn:altinn:resource:[prop1].[prop2]`, og ressursen må være registrert i Altinn Ressursregister før hendelsen publiseres."}, "wg-tech-03-ioption-properties" {:reference-answer "The IOption interface (which extends IValidate) defines: Name (string, the name of the option that must match the name of the option in the CommandDefinition file); ApiName (string, the name of the option in the API); Value (string, the value of the option as a string); IsAssigned (bool, defines if the option is given a value on the command line); Description (string, the description of the option used by help); Range (string, valid range for the parameter); and the method GetValue() which gets the typed value of the option as defined in the option definition."}, "wg-dialog-03-token-claims" {:reference-answer "A Dialogporten dialog token contains the following claims: c (authenticated consumer of Dialogporten; the prefix for individuals, organizations, or self-registered users), l (security level of authentication, e.g. 4), u (optional; if a provider token in Maskinporten has been used, the authenticated provider's organization number), p (whom the consumer is acting on behalf of, i.e. who owns the relevant dialogue), i (unique identifier of the dialogue), s (the service resource that the dialogue refers to), and a (authorized actions/authorization attributes)."}, "wg-authz-13-connections-api-operations-nb" {:reference-answer "Operasjonene som beskrives er: Delegere tilgangspakke (POST .../connections/accesspackages); Fjerne tilgangspakke (DELETE .../connections/accesspackages); Hente roller for en tilkobling (GET .../connections/roles); Hente ressurser for en tilkobling (GET .../connections/resources); Fjerne ressursdelegering (DELETE .../connections/resources); Hente enkeltrettigheter for en ressurs (GET .../connections/resources/rights); og Kontrollere delegeringsmulighet for ressurs (GET .../connections/resources/delegationcheck)."}, "ue-corr-02-transmission-group-dialog" {:reference-answer "Du knytter den nye meldingen til en eksisterende dialog ved å legge inn en ekstern referanse i `externalReferences` der `referenceValue` settes til `dialogId` for dialogen og `referenceType` settes til `DialogportenDialogId`; da grupperes relaterte instanser i samme dialog (transmission). Du kan eventuelt sette transmission-type med en egen ekstern referanse av `referenceType` `DialogportenTransmissionType` (verdi som `Information` eller `1`); hvis den ikke settes, er typen Information (1)."}, "wg-broker-05-transition-considerations-nb" {:reference-answer "Viktige hensyn: (1) Forespørsler som kan spesifisere ServiceCode/ServiceEdition overføres umiddelbart til Altinn 3 via Altinn 3 Broker Bridge; hvis SC/SE kan spesifiseres, men ikke er det, overføres ikke forespørselen. (2) Forespørsler som ikke kan spesifisere SC/SE gjør først oppslag i Altinn 2 Formidlings datalager, og dersom ingenting finnes, overføres forespørselen til Altinn 3. (3) Filer i Altinn 3 kan ikke være større enn 1 GB (maksimal filstørrelse i Altinn 2), og tjenesten i Altinn 3 skal konfigureres med denne MaxFileSize-begrensningen. (4) Fildata og metadata lagres i Altinn 3 datalager, mens Altinn 2-kall overføres til Altinn 3. (5) Kvitteringer lagres ikke lenger i Altinn 2; en pseudokvittering genereres fra Altinn 3-metadata, og kvitterings-tjenesten i Altinn 2 brukes ikke lenger for overførte formidlingstjenester. (6) Bruk av manifestfilen i innsendt fildata støttes ikke lenger i Altinn 3, men funksjonalitet for manifest-filer kan skrus på i overgangsløsningen."}, "wg-studio-15-list-component-properties" {:reference-answer "The List component's required properties are id, type, alternatives, and default. Its available properties include: id, type, dataModelBindings, textResourceBindings (with textResourceBindings.title), bindingToShowInSummary (the binding whose value is shown in the summary, which must be one of the dataModelBindings), dataListId (the id used to retrieve the datalist from the backend), grid (with gridSettings.innerGrid and gridSettings.labelGrid), hidden, mapping (maps data model paths to query parameters when fetching list data), pageBreak (with pageBreak.breakAfter and pageBreak.breakBefore), pagination, renderAsSummary, secure (whether options are instance aware), sortableColumns (columns that are sortable), tableHeaders (maps datalist fields to header names), and tableHeadersMobile (columns shown in mobile view)."}, "wg-dialog-02-system-labels" {:reference-answer "Systemetikettene i Dialogporten er: Default (gjensidig utelukkende med Bin/Archive), Bin (gjensidig utelukkende med Default/Archive), Archive (gjensidig utelukkende med Default/Bin), Sent (legges automatisk til av Dialogporten når en forsendelse av typen Submission eller Correction legges til dialogen; kan ikke legges til eller fjernes av tjenesteeiere eller sluttbrukere) og MarkedAsUnopened (markerer en dialog som uåpnet/ulest; kan settes og fjernes av tjenesteeiere og sluttbrukere). Default, Bin og Archive er påkrevde og gjensidig utelukkende, slik at en dialog bare kan ha én av disse om gangen."}, "wg-studio-20-layout-component-common-props" {:reference-answer "De felles layout-egenskapene for komponenter er: id (string) - komponentens ID, unik innenfor layout-settet, kan ikke ende med <bindestrek><nummer>; type (string enum) - komponenttype; required (boolean) - om komponenten er påkrevd, standard false; readOnly (boolean) - om komponenten vises som kun lese, standard false; renderAsSummary (boolean) - om komponenten vises som sammendrag, standard false; hidden (boolean) - om komponenten skjules, standard false; textResourceBindings (object) - tekstressursbindinger; dataModelBindings (object) - datamodellbindinger; triggers (array) - handlinger som utløses når data endres; labelSettings (object) - innstillinger for hvordan etiketten vises; grid (object) - innstillinger for komponentens rutenett for horisontal justering; og pageBreak (object) - kun PDF, om et sideskift legges til før eller etter komponenten."}, "wg-broker-04-event-types-by-role-nb" {:reference-answer "For avsendere gjelder hendelsestypene: no.altinn.broker.filetransferinitialized, no.altinn.broker.uploadprocessing, no.altinn.broker.uploadfailed, no.altinn.broker.allconfirmeddownloaded og no.altinn.broker.filepurged. For både avsendere og mottakere gjelder: no.altinn.broker.published, no.altinn.broker.downloadconfirmed og no.altinn.broker.fileneverconfirmeddownloaded."}, "wg-dialog-01-fce-cps-validering" {:reference-answer "The CPS must validate the received dialog token by checking the token signature against the JWKs published by Dialogporten and by checking that the token is not expired. It may perform additional validations (for example checking the 'actions' claim). It may validate the Origin header, but must not rely on this header alone for authorization purposes, because it can be easily spoofed. Given successful authorization and no other errors, the CPS must respond with 200 OK (or 204 No Content if the body is empty) and a Content-Type header matching the FCE media type (currently text/markdown or text/html)."}, "wg-events-03-query-params-enduser" {:reference-answer "The GET /app/party endpoint accepts these query parameters: the ID of the event last retrieved (string) – the result set includes events registered after the provided event ID in chronological order; the lower limit for when the cloud event was registered in UTC (string date-time); the upper limit for when the cloud event was registered in UTC (string date-time); the party ID representing the subject of the cloud event; the organisation number representing the unit in the cloud event's alternative subject; the person number representing the person in the cloud event's alternative subject; the event sources to include (array of string), which supports the wildcard % to escape an unknown number of characters; the event types to include (array of string); and the size of the result set (string), with a default size of 50 events."}, "wg-notif-07-api-auth-types" {:reference-answer "The Notifications API documentation describes three forms of authentication and authorization: the Altinn token – the API is secured using OAuth2 and all requests must include a valid Altinn token in the Authorization header or the AltinnStudioRuntime cookie; Maskinporten scopes – some endpoints require additional authorization in the form of a Maskinporten scope representing a permission a consumer has access to; and the Platform Access token – access to a subset of endpoints is limited to callers within the Altinn ecosystem and requires a Platform Access Token."}, "wg-events-01-subscription-response-codes" {:reference-answer "The subscription registration endpoint can return: 201 Created – the subscription has been successfully registered; 401 Unauthorized – a missing, invalid or expired authorization header, or the consumer is not allowed to subscribe to events from this resource based on filter parameters; and 403 Forbidden – missing required scope or authorisation (check user roles or access packages against the event source policy)."}, "wg-studio-19-map-component-center" {:reference-answer "For Map-komponenten settes kartets midtpunkt med centerLocation (et objekt med centerLocation.latitude som setter breddegraden og centerLocation.longitude som setter lengdegraden). Kartlag defineres med layers (en liste med kartlag), der hvert lag har layers.attribution (tekst som viser hvor kartlaget hentes fra), layers.subdomains (liste over underdomener for å balansere belastning på map-tiling-servere, der en tilfeldig server erstatter {s} i URL-en) og layers.url (URL-en til kartlaget)."}, "ue-api-05-events-post-app-token" {:recall20-zero? true, :reference-answer "Publishing an app event via `POST /app` requires authentication and a Platform Access Token in the header. The request body must contain a Cloud Event formatted as an AppCloudEventRequestModel and serialized as a JSON string (Events sets the event's id and time itself). The event should include at least the event type, source (URI), the instanceOwner's party ID, and the cloud-event spec version, with the subject in the format `/party/{partyId}` (an alternative subject may also be included)."}, "ue-sys-03-brukerstyrt-vs-leverandorstyrt" {:reference-answer "Forskjellen er hvem som initierer opprettelsen og hvordan godkjenningen skjer. Ved brukerstyrt (sluttbrukerstyrt) opprettelse logger sluttbrukeren selv inn i Altinn, velger hvilket system systembrukeren skal opprettes for, og godkjenner de forhåndsdefinerte tilgangene systemet krever — systembrukeren opprettes da direkte uten at det genereres en separat forespørsel. Ved leverandørstyrt opprettelse er det sluttbrukersystem-leverandøren (SBSL) som sender en forespørsel til Altinn om å opprette systembrukeren, og sluttbrukeren må deretter godkjenne forespørselen i Altinn før systembrukeren opprettes."}, "wg-apptmpl-01-react-best-practices" {:reference-answer "The app frontend tries to follow these React architecture best-practices: small, function-specific components (UI components are \"dumb\", keeping logic to a minimum); reusability (UI components shared across apps and between app frontend and receipt frontend, using Material UI components as much as possible instead of building custom ones); DRY code (shared resources/utils across features and between app frontend and receipt frontend to avoid duplication); comments only where necessary (self-explanatory function and component names, avoiding clutter); component names in capital; keeping complex data-loading logic separate from rendering of components (state handled by redux, data passed as props to UI components where possible); using a feature-based code structure (grouping code by feature rather than by function); and following linting rules (using a code analyzer for clean, readable code)."}, "ue-authz-03-validere-samtykketoken" {:reference-answer "Som tjenesteeier validerer du samtykketokenet ved å kontrollere at rettighetene i tokenet, under `consentRights`, samsvarer med de rettighetene tjenesten din krever. I Altinn 3 er samtykketokenet et vanlig Maskinporten-token som i tillegg inneholder feltet `authorization_details` (med `type` `urn:altinn:consent`), og det er dette feltet du bruker for å verifisere at nødvendig samtykke er gitt."}, "wg-studio-08-packagereferences-fields" {:reference-answer "Hvert element i packageReferences-arrayet krever tre felter, alle påkrevd: project (string) - relativ bane eller glob-mønster til .csproj-fil(er), absolutte baner er ikke tillatt; include (string) - NuGet-pakkenavn (f.eks. \"Newtonsoft.Json\"); og version (string) - pakkeversjon (f.eks. \"1.2.3\", \"1.2.3-preview\", \"[1.2.3]\", \"1.2.*\"). Hvis pakken finnes oppdateres versjonen; finnes den ikke legges den til i en eksisterende eller ny ItemGroup, og prosjektmønsteret må matche nøyaktig én .csproj-fil."}, "wg-studio-12-accordiongroup-component-types" {:reference-answer "The AccordionGroup layout example (in App/ui/layouts/{page}.json) uses four component types: AccordionGroup (the parent, with children accordion1 and accordion2), Accordion (accordion1 and accordion2, the latter with headingLevel 2), Paragraph (paragraph1, paragraph2 and paragraph3), and Button (the ok-button). The AccordionGroup contains Accordion children, and each Accordion contains Paragraph and/or Button children."}, "wg-authz-02-apischeme-required-attributes-en" {:reference-answer "The necessary attributes are: identifier (globally unique ID, also used in policy); title (must be provided for en, nb and nn); description (must be provided for en, nb and nn); rightDescription (delegation description, for en, nb and nn); resourceReferences (a reference with referenceType MaskinportenScope); delegable (must be true to be delegable to a provider); visible (must be true to be delegable to a provider); hasCompetentAuthority (the service owner, set with organization number and service owner code); and resourceType (must be set to MaskinportenSchema)."}, "ue-broker-02-slette-tid-tilgjengelig" {:reference-answer "In Altinn Broker the sender controls availability via `FileTransferTimeToLive` (default 30 days, maximum 1 year). To have the file deleted once all required recipients have confirmed download, set `PurgeFileTransferAfterAllRecipientsConfirmed = true`; the `PurgeFileTransferGracePeriod` then controls how long the file stays available after confirmation before deletion (default 2 hours, maximum 24 hours)."}, "wg-studio-11-file-validation-steps" {:reference-answer "For å ta i bruk MIME-type-validering kreves fire steg: (1) Legg til en referanse til Altinn.FileAnalyzers NuGet-pakken ved å kjøre `nuget install Altinn.FileAnalyzers` i App-mappen; (2) Registrer tjenesten med `services.AddMimeTypeValidation();`; (3) Konfigurer validatoren per datatype i applicationmetadata.json ved å sette enabledFileAnalysers til [\"mimeTypeAnalyser\"] og enabledFileValidators til [\"mimeTypeValidator\"] (sammen med f.eks. allowedContentTypes, taskId, maxSize, maxCount, minCount); og (4) Legg til støtte for JSON-objekter i dataresponsen ved å sette FeatureManagement.JsonObjectInDataResponse til true, slik at frontend ser etter JSON i svaret for å gi en feilmelding."}, "wg-authz-12-connections-api-operations-en" {:reference-answer "The connection API operations described are: Delegate access package (POST .../connections/accesspackages); Remove access package (DELETE .../connections/accesspackages); Retrieve roles for a connection (GET .../connections/roles); Retrieve resources for a connection (GET .../connections/resources); Remove resource delegation (DELETE .../connections/resources); Retrieve individual rights for a resource (GET .../connections/resources/rights); and Check delegation eligibility for a resource (GET .../connections/resources/delegationcheck)."}, "ue-authz-05-xacml-policy-regelstruktur" {:reference-answer "A XACML policy in Altinn describes the access rules for an app created in Altinn Studio, a resource in the Altinn Resource Registry, or a correspondence/broker service in Altinn 3 (following the XACML 3.0 standard with a limited feature set). A policy consists of 1-to-many rules, and each rule has three parts: Resource (what the rule applies to), Action (e.g. read, write, sign), and Subject (who it applies to — a role, access group, organization number, or user). A rule can combine multiple resources, actions, and subjects."}, "ue-authz-01-delegere-tilgangspakke-api" {:reference-answer "Du delegerer en tilgangspakke til en person med `POST` til `/accessmanagement/api/v1/enduser/connections/accesspackages` (test: `https://platform.tt02.altinn.no...`, produksjon: `https://platform.altinn.no...`). Spørreparametere er `party` (UUID, obligatorisk — partyUuid for parten) og valgfritt `to` (UUID — partyUuid for mottaker, alternativ til body), `packageId` (UUID) eller `package` (URN for tilgangspakken). Mottaker kan alternativt angis i body, f.eks. med `personIdentifier` og `lastName`."}, "wg-tech-02-development-tools" {:reference-answer "Testing: automated browser and WCAG testing uses Cypress; Jest is used for front-end unit testing and xunit for back-end unit testing; API testing is done with Postman; integration testing of services uses standard Microsoft frameworks; performance testing will use K6; Azure Test Plans in Azure DevOps is used for execution tracking; and defects are reported as issues in Github using the Bug template. Design and prototyping uses Figma, with application design written in MarkDown and published on the site and Visio for application drawings. Source control: Github is used for all open source code, and Azure Repos in Azure DevOps Services is used for other artefacts. IDEs are Visual Studio Code and Visual Studio. Build tools vary by framework: .Net build for .Net packages and applications (with Nuget packages for reuse), Node as the main tool for JavaScript packages and applications, Lerna, and Maven for Java applications. All applications are built as Docker Containers using Docker Build."}, "ue-sys-02-systembrukertoken-pdp-autorisasjon" {:recall20-zero? true, :needs-review true, :note "Golden shows the systembrukertoken and that systemuser_id is the key value Altinn needs to authorize; it does NOT show a concrete PDP request/endpoint. The PDP-call detail (AccessSubject / Permit) is inferred from the expected-answer-pattern and adjacent docs — verify or soften the PDP-call sentence when reviewing.", :reference-answer "Den sentrale verdien er `authorization_details[].systemuser_id` i systembrukertokenet — den unike ID-en for systembrukeren, og det er denne Altinn trenger for å autorisere tilgang (det er systembrukeren som har fått delegert tilgangene). Tokenet valideres som et standard Maskinporten-token, men inneholder i tillegg `authorization_details` med `type` `urn:altinn:systemuser` (samt `systemuser_org.id` for organisasjonen som opprettet systembrukeren). Tjenesteeier bruker `systemuser_id` som AccessSubject i kallet mot Altinn Autorisasjon (PDP) for å få et Permit/Deny-svar på tilgangen."}, "ue-dialog-05-search-rest-graphql" {:reference-answer "Dialogporten støtter både REST og GraphQL for å søke etter dialoger i sluttbruker-API-et, mens tjenesteeier-API-et støtter REST-søk med ekstra filtre. Du får mindre informasjon i søkeresultatet enn i detaljvisningen fordi datastrukturen som returneres i søk er forskjellig fra den som returneres fra detaljendepunktet — mer informasjon om dialogen og hvilken tilgang den autoriserte brukeren har til ulike deler av den er bare tilgjengelig i detaljvisningen."}, "ue-corr-01-events-webhook-subscription" {:recall20-zero? true, :reference-answer "To receive events/webhooks from Altinn Correspondence you must set up a subscription for the resource, which configures the endpoint the events are delivered to. As a recipient you are required to set two filters: `resourceFilter` = `urn:altinn:resource:` + the Resource Id of the Correspondence resource, and `subjectFilter` = `urn:altinn:organization:identifier-no:{recipient orgnumber}`. Events follow the CloudEvent pattern (e.g. type `no.altinn.correspondence.correspondencepublished`)."}, "ue-broker-04-overgang-a2-a3-forskjeller" {:recall20-zero? false, :reference-answer "For end users there is little technical difference between an Altinn 2 Broker service and one transitioned to Altinn 3, but consumers should review the docs for required code changes. Functionally, receipts will no longer have a Receipt Id, and (if enabled) manifest files will no longer have a File List. Virus scanning also changes: in Altinn 3 it is done after upload, so an uploaded file is not immediately available and only becomes available once the automatic virus scan completes. Getting receipts via the external Receipt SOAP endpoint is not supported."}, "ue-notif-07-standard-avsender-sms-epost" {:reference-answer "Uten egen konfigurasjon er standardavsenderen på SMS «Altinn» («Altinn-test» i testmiljøet), og på e-post `noreply@altinn` (`noreply-tt02@altinn.no` i testmiljøet og `noreply@altinn.cloud` i ytelsestestmiljøet)."}, "wg-security-01-information-security" {:reference-answer "According to Digdir's obligation to maintain responsibility for information security under the Personal Data Act § 1, cf. GDPR Article 32, information security includes: ensuring confidentiality (protection against unauthorized access to the information); ensuring integrity (protection against accidental alteration of the information); and ensuring availability (making sure that adequate and relevant information is accessible)."}, "wg-dialog-05-instance-status-summaries" {:reference-answer "Når ingen tilpassede applikasjonstekstnøkler finnes, gir systemet innebygde standard sammendragstekster for følgende instansstatuser: archivedunconfirmed, archivedconfirmed, rejected, awaitingserviceownerfeedback, awaitingconfirmation, awaitingsignature, awaitingadditionaluserinput og awaitinginitialuserinput (default)."}, "wg-broker-08-news-enhancements-en" {:reference-answer "The highlighted new features are: support for really large files (transfer of files larger than 2 GB, up to 100 GB or more); an Altinn Broker configuration GUI (an Altinn Studio based GUI for configuring Altinn Broker resources); and an Altinn Broker client GUI (an Altinn Studio based default GUI for file upload and download, as an alternative to custom end-user systems)."}, "wg-community-01-v7-instantiation-interfaces" {:reference-answer "The logic previously defined in App/logic/InstantiationHandler.cs is now defined by implementing two interfaces: IInstantiationProcessor, used to do custom data/instance manipulation during instantiation, which replaces the DataCreation method in InstantiationHandler; and IInstantiationValidator, used to do custom validation during instantiation, which replaces the RunInstantiationValidation method in InstantiationHandler."}, "ue-sys-01-leverandorstyrt-og-forhold" {:reference-answer "Nei. Ved en leverandørstyrt opprettelse bygger forespørselen på et «OG-forhold»: sluttbrukeren (kunden) må ha myndighet til å delegere samtlige tilganger som leverandøren etterspør. Mangler brukeren myndighet for selv én av tilgangene, kan forespørselen ikke godkjennes i sin helhet — det er altså ikke mulig å godkjenne bare noen av tilgangene."}, "wg-studio-03-correspondence-scopes" {:reference-answer "To use the correspondence service, a Maskinporten client needs access to the following three scopes: altinn:serviceowner, altinn:correspondence.read, and altinn:correspondence.write."}, "wg-studio-09-footer-component-types" {:reference-answer "The footer supports four component types: Email (properties: type, title, target = the email address), Phone (type, title, target = the phone number), Link (type, title, target = the URL, and icon which is one of information, email or phone), and Text (type and title; the Text title supports formatting whereas Email, Phone and Link titles do not). The footer is defined in App/ui/footer.json and new components are added to the footer array."}, "ue-dialog-07-webapi-sdk" {:reference-answer "Når den automatiske synkroniseringen ikke gir nok kontroll, kan du bruke Dialogporten WebAPI SDK, som gir applikasjonen din programmatisk tilgang til Dialogporten slik at du selv kan opprette og oppdatere dialoger. Dette muliggjør finkornet håndtering av aktiviteter, forsendelser og synkronisering med Altinn Innboks."}, "wg-studio-16-textarea-properties" {:reference-answer "The required properties of the TextArea component are id, type, and dataModelBindings."}, "ue-events-03-polling-vs-webhook" {:reference-answer "Ja — Events API tilbyr et HTTP API for planlagte forespørsler (querying) av de samme hendelsesdataene, så du kan hente hendelser ved å polle i stedet for å bruke webhooks. Men Altinn Events er designet spesifikt for å unngå polling, og webhooks/abonnement er den anbefalte måten å motta hendelser på; poll-API-et er først og fremst ment for å støtte gradvise, inkrementelle arkitekturmigrasjoner."}, "wg-events-01-abonnement-pakrevde-filtre" {:reference-answer "To filterfelt er påkrevd for et abonnement i Altinn Events: resourceFilter (filter for hendelseskilden; påkrevd, men Altinn Events kan fylle det ut automatisk basert på source-verdien hvis den er en gyldig URL til en Altinn Studio App) og subjectFilter (filter for cloud event-subjektet, med eksakt treff-sammenligning). subjectFilter er påkrevd med mindre du er tjenesteeier – tjenesteeiere kan utelate feltet og abonnere på alle hendelser på tvers av alle parter/subjekter. Å sette subjectFilter til en tom streng fører til at abonnementet stille feiler med å levere hendelser."}, "wg-studio-14-multipage-gruppe" {:reference-answer "For å dele opp utfyllingen av en repeterende gruppe over flere sider må du prefikse hver komponent i children-listen med et tall som tilsier hvilken side komponenten skal vises på, etterfulgt av kolon. Tellingen starter på 0, så komponenter på første side prefikses med 0:, andre side med 1:, osv. I tillegg må du sette \"multiPage\": true i edit-parameteren. Funksjonaliteten er kun tilgjengelig for repeterende grupper og kun for grupper på øverste nivå (ikke grupper i grupper); navigeringen skjer innad i en layout og oppdaterer kun visningen inne i redigeringsflaten for gruppen. Man kan også sette en mode som hideTable for å skjule tabellen under redigering."}, "wg-studio-18-consume-api-registration" {:reference-answer "Register the client in App/Program.cs (.NET 6) or App/Startup.cs (.NET 5) inside RegisterCustomAppServices using services.AddHttpClient<ICountryClient, CountryClient>(), and add the relevant using statements. Then make the client available in DataProcessingHandler.cs by creating a constructor, adding a private field, and injecting the client (e.g. ICountryClient) into the constructor. Use the client in the ProcessDataWrite method to enrich the form data. Because DataProcessingHandler is instantiated in App.cs, you must inject the dependency (e.g. ICountryClient) as the last parameter of the App.cs constructor and pass it into the new DataProcessingHandler(...). Note that stateless apps do not call ProcessDataWrite - use ProcessDataRead instead. Responses can be cached (e.g. with IMemoryCache and a 24-hour expiration) in the client to avoid repeated API calls."}, "wg-broker-10-capabilities-nfr-categories-nb" {:reference-answer "Kategoriene for ikke-funksjonelle krav er: Ytelseskrav, Skalerbarhet, Tilgjengelighet og pålitelighet, Sikkerhet, Vedlikehold og oppgradering, Katastrofegjenoppretting og backup, Brukervennlighet, Interoperabilitet, Etterlevelse og juridiske krav, Overvåking og logging, Dataintegritet og kvalitet, Lastbalansering, og Miljømessige og operasjonelle forhold."}, "wg-studio-22-instance-create-notification" {:reference-answer "In the /instances/create request body, alongside instanceOwner, the notification object contains: notificationChannel (a numeric channel, e.g. 4); customSms, which has senderName and a text object with localized strings (nb, nn, en); and customEmail, which has a subject object and a body object, each with localized strings (nb, nn, en). The same notification structure is used in the multipart /instances request."}, "wg-community-02-v5-removed-services" {:reference-answer "Because all PDF generation code was extracted from AppBase.cs into PdfService.cs (implementing IPdfService), the services no longer used in the call to base(...) in the App constructor and which should be removed are: processService, settings, and textService."}, "wg-broker-01-webhook-event-types-en" {:reference-answer "Altinn 3 Broker publishes these webhook event types: filetransferinitialized (information about a new file transfer), filedeleted (the file has been deleted from Broker), fileneverconfirmeddownloaded (file was never confirmed downloaded by a recipient), uploadprocessing (file has been uploaded and is being processed), published (file has finished processing and is ready for download), uploadfailed (an upload failed during upload or processing), downloadconfirmed (a recipient confirmed their download), and allconfirmeddownloaded (all recipients have confirmed the download)."}, "wg-authz-05-systemregister-scopes-nb" {:reference-answer "For systembruker får du tilgang til scopene: altinn:authentication/systemuser.request.read, altinn:authentication/systemuser.request.write og altinn:authentication/systemregister.write. Dersom sluttbrukersystemet skal gjøre klientdelegering via API, trengs i tillegg: altinn:clientdelegations.read og altinn:clientdelegations.write."}, "wg-notif-02-sms-recommendations" {:reference-answer "For å sikre at SMS-meldingene leveres som forventet anbefales følgende: (1) Hold meldinger korte og konsise – under 160 tegn om mulig; (2) Unngå unødvendige emojier – disse kan øke lengden betydelig; (3) Test med representative data – bruk spesialtegn som ligner på det du vil bruke i produksjon; (4) Planlegg for segmentering – dersom du vet at meldingen blir lang, sørg for at den fortsatt gir mening selv om den deles opp; (5) Vurder alternative kanaler – for lengre meldinger kan e-post være et bedre valg."}, "ue-dialog-06-skrivehandlinger" {:reference-answer "Skrivehandlinger lar GUI-handlinger utføre tilstandsendrende operasjoner direkte fra nettleserbaserte sluttbrukersystemer uten behov for full sidenavigering, noe som gir en mer sammenhengende brukeropplevelse. Vanlige GUI-handlinger er som standard begrenset til leseoperasjoner (navigere til en side eller laste ned en fil via HTTP GET), mens skrivehandlinger gjør det mulig å utføre tilstandsendrende operasjoner — i motsetning til API-handlinger som uansett kan bruke alle HTTP-metoder og input/output-modeller."}, "wg-events-06-api-auth-types" {:reference-answer "The Events API documentation describes these forms of authentication and authorization: the Altinn token – the API is secured using OAuth2 and all requests must include a valid Altinn token in the Authorization header or the AltinnStudioRuntime cookie; Maskinporten scopes – some endpoints require additional authorization in the form of a Maskinporten scope representing a permission a consumer has access to; the Platform Access token – access to a subset of endpoints is limited to callers within the Altinn ecosystem and requires a Platform Access Token; and Private APIs – a set of APIs only accessible within the Events component, marked as Private API in the OpenAPI specification, which require an access token in the request header."}, "wg-dialog-07-fce-handling-steps" {:reference-answer "The basic steps to handle front channel embeds (FCEs) are: 1) Perform a GET request to the indicated URL, supplying the dialog token in an Authorization: Bearer header; 2) Based on the indicated media type, parse the response (usually markdown) and convert it to the presentation format (usually HTML); 3) Inject the converted data into the GUI. Note that there may be several FCEs in a dialog: one (or zero) on a dialog level and one (or zero) per transmission. The endpoints are expected to fully support the CORS protocol, including pre-flight, enabling the use of fetch() and similar APIs."}, "wg-authz-14-skatt-avgift-accesspackages-nb" {:reference-answer "Tilgangspakkene er: Skatt næring (skatt-naering); Skattegrunnlag (skattegrunnlag); Merverdiavgift (merverdiavgift); Motorvognavgifter (motorvognavgift); Særavgifter (saeravgifter); Krav, betalinger og utlegg (krav-og-utlegg); Kreditt- og oppgjørsordninger (kreditt-og-oppgjoer); Regnskap og økonomirapportering (regnskap-okonomi-rapport); Revisorattesterer (reviorattesterer); Toll (toll); Revisjon (revisjon); og MVA-kompensasjon revisorattesterer (mva-kompensasjon-revisorattesterer)."}, "wg-corr-06-prepublish-recipient-failures" {:reference-answer "Under publiseringsvalideringen settes meldingen til status Failed dersom mottakerstatusen er ugyldig av en av følgende grunner: Recipient Reserved in KRR, Organization Not Found, Organization Bankrupt, Organization Deleted, eller Missing Required Roles."}, "ue-dialog-02-seen-log" {:reference-answer "In Dialogporten a dialog is 'seen' when a particular dialog ID has been requested from the API — the seen log is populated automatically and records who accessed a dialog at a given revision. It does not indicate whether the content was read or understood, attachments were downloaded, or actions were performed. Using the search or list API does not populate the seen log; entries are recorded per user per revision (only the first access by a given user for a given revision)."}, "ue-notif-05-umiddelbar-varsling-otp" {:reference-answer "Ja — bruk Umiddelbar varsling i Altinn Varsling, som sender meldinger øyeblikkelig til én mottaker (e-postadresse eller telefonnummer) og er laget nettopp for tidskritiske ting som en engangskode (OTP) ved innlogging. For å sende så raskt som mulig hele døgnet kan du utelate `requestedSendTime` og bruke `sendingTimePolicy` satt til `Anytime`. Tjenesten er semisynkron: API-et returnerer `201 Created` eller `200 OK` med `shipmentId` og `notificationOrderId`, mens leveringsstatus hentes asynkront (responskoden bekrefter bare at bestillingen ble registrert, ikke at leveringen lyktes)."}, "wg-events-05-azure-functions" {:reference-answer "Følgende Azure Functions er satt opp for å frikoble prosessering og utsending av hendelser samt abonnementsvalidering: EventsRegistration – sender hendelser til internt API-endepunkt som lagrer cloud event vedvarende til database og ved suksess sender til internt API-endepunkt for innkommende prosessering; EventsInbound – sender hendelse til internt API-endepunkt som finner abonnementer med filtre som matcher cloud event; EventsOutbound – POST-er cloud event til webhook-endepunkt tilknyttet et abonnement; og SubscriptionValidation – POST-er validerings-cloud event til brukerdefinert webhook-endepunkt for å sjekke at det er klart til å motta data, og sender ved suksess en forespørsel til internt API-endepunkt som oppdaterer statusen i databasen."}, "ue-broker-03-store-filer-virusskann" {:reference-answer "Yes, but conditionally: Broker is restricted to 2 GB by default because of the virus scan, and you can send larger files only if the resource has virus scanning disabled (which requires pre-approval from Altinn). The theoretical maximum size is 1.6 TB (regularly benchmarked to 100 GB); equivalently the product supports up to ~1600 GB without virus scanning and up to 2 GB with it."}, "wg-api-09-systemuser-vendor-endpoint-en" {:reference-answer "You use GET authentication/api/v1/systemuser/vendor/bysystem/{systemId}, where {systemId} is the unique identifier of the registered system. It requires a Maskinporten token with scope altinn:authentication/systemregister.write, and the response content type is application/json."}, "wg-corr-01-varslingskanaler" {:reference-answer "When adding a notification to a Correspondence message, the notificationChannel field accepts five values: Email (0), Sms (1), EmailPreferred (2), SmsPreferred (3), and EmailAndSms (4). The same five channels are also available for the reminderNotificationChannel field used for reminders."}, "wg-api-08-systemregister-get-endpoints-nb" {:reference-answer "Det finnes to GET-endepunkter: GET authentication/api/v1/systemregister/vendor/{systemId} for å hente et system ved system-ID, og GET authentication/api/v1/systemregister/vendor/{systemId}/changelog for å hente endringsloggen (liste over endringer) for et system. Begge krever et Maskinporten-token med scope altinn:authentication/systemregister.write og bruker content type application/json. systemId skal være i formatet {systemleverandørorgnr}_{navn valgt av leverandøren}."}, "wg-authz-03-apischeme-required-attributes-nb" {:reference-answer "De nødvendige attributtene er: identifier (globalt unik ID for ressurs, brukes også i policy); title (tittel, må oppgis for en, nb og nn); description (beskrivelse, må oppgis for en, nb og nn); rightDescription (delegeringsbeskrivelse, må oppgis for en, nb og nn); resourceReferences (en resource reference med referencetype MaskinportenScope); delegable (må settes til true for at scope skal kunne delegeres til leverandør); visible (må settes til true for at scope skal kunne delegeres til leverandør); hasCompetentAuthority (definerer tjenesteeier, settes med organisasjonsnummer og riktig tjenesteeierkode); og resourceType (må settes til MaskinportenSchema)."}, "wg-community-06-frontend-v4-ai-optin" {:reference-answer "You can opt in for an automatic AI-generated pull request that migrates the removed v3 tracks feature (IPageOrder / calculatePageOrder) to the new dynamic-expressions page-order approach. To opt in on a single repository: 1) In Gitea, go to the repository where you want to opt in; 2) go to the Settings tab; 3) go to the Collaboration section; 4) add 'altinn_sa_ai (Altinn AI [Bot])'; 5) the PR will be created in a nightly run if the bot finds any tracks. To opt in on a service-owner level (all repositories in your organization): 1) in Gitea, go to your organization at https://altinn.studio/repos/<orgname>; 2) go to the Teams tab; 3) click the 'Devs' team; 4) add 'altinn_sa_ai (Altinn AI [Bot])' to the team; 5) a PR will be created in a nightly run in any repository where the bot finds the tracks implementation. The migrated result may not be a 100% match, so you should always review and test the PR before merging. The generative model used is 'gpt-4-1106-preview' from OpenAI, hosted as a dedicated instance on Digdir's internal Azure subscription, with information limited to the relevant C# classes implementing IPageOrder and not shared with any third party for training."}, "wg-events-04-spoerreparametere-nb" {:reference-answer "GET /app/{org}/{app}-endepunktet godtar disse spørreparametrene: ID for hendelsen som sist ble hentet (string) – resultatsettet inkluderer hendelser registrert etter den oppgitte hendelses-ID-en i kronologisk rekkefølge; nedre grense for når Cloud Event ble registrert i UTC (string date-time); øvre grense for når Cloud Event ble registrert i UTC (string date-time); part-ID som representerer subjektet i Cloud Event; organisasjonsnummeret som representerer enheten i Cloud Events alternative subject; personnummeret som representerer personen i Cloud Events alternative subject; hendelsestypene som skal inkluderes (array av string); og størrelse på resultatsettet (string), med en standard størrelse på 50 hendelser."}, "wg-dialog-10-fce-response-handling" {:reference-answer "Ved håndtering av svaret må SBS: følge omdirigeringssvar (3xx), men også håndtere uendelige omdirigeringer ved å begrense antall omdirigeringer til minst 5; sørge for at den returnerte Content-Type-headeren samsvarer med FCE-medietypen; håndtere en tom responskropp, der ingen UI-endringer skal skje (slik at ILS kan bruke FCE-er til å utløse eksterne prosesser); og ved et vellykket svar (200 OK) med en ikke-tom kropp, gjengi innholdet og injisere det i brukergrensesnittet. ILS kan svare med 204 No Content når kroppen er tom."}, "ue-broker-01-filoverforing-tilstander" {:reference-answer "En filoverføring i Altinn Formidling går gjennom tilstandene i en endelig tilstandsmaskin: Initialisert → Opplasting pågår → Sjekk av opplasting → Publisert → Nedlastinger initiert → Alle bekreftet nedlastet → Slettet. I tillegg finnes to slutt-/feiltilstander: Avbrutt (bare mulig så lenge ingen nedlasting har startet) og Overføring feilet."}, "wg-corr-05-prepublish-errors" {:reference-answer "During validation of an initialized correspondence, a 400 Bad Request can be caused by: Missing Content, Empty Message Fields, Invalid Format, Invalid Attachments, Invalid Dates, or Invalid Language. A 401 Unauthorized can be caused by: No Access to Resource or Incorrect Resource Type."}, "wg-authz-15-oppvekst-utdanning-accesspackages-nb" {:reference-answer "Tilgangspakkene er: Barnehageeier (barnehageeier); Barnehageleder (barnehageleder); Barnehagemyndighet (barnehagemyndighet); Statsforvalter - barnehage (statsforvalter-barnehage); Statsforvalter - skole og opplæring (statsforvalter-skole-og-opplearing); Skoleeier (skoleeier); Skoleleder (skoleleder); Opplæringskontorleder (opplaeringskontorleder); PPT-leder (ppt-leder); SFO-leder (sfo-leder); Høyere utdanning og høyere yrkesfaglig utdanning (hoyere-utdanning-og-hoyere-yrkesfaglig-utdanning); Godkjenning av personell (godkjenning-av-personell); og Godkjenning av utdanningsvirksomhet (godkjenning-av-utdanningsvirksomhet)."}, "wg-api-04-app-metadata-fields-en" {:reference-answer "The application metadata model contains these fields: id, versionId, org, title, validFrom, validTo, processId, dataTypes, partyTypesAllowed, autoDeleteOnProcessEnd, presentationFields, dataFields, eFormidling, and messageBoxConfig."}, "ue-corr-03-system-til-system-nedlasting" {:reference-answer "For store volumer av meldinger med vedlegg bør dere integrere mot API (system-til-system) i stedet for å behandle dem manuelt i innboksen — GUI-innboksen er primært egnet for manuell behandling i mindre skala, mens effektiv håndtering av større mengder forutsetter integrasjon. Ved å integrere sak-/arkivsystemet mot Altinn via Dialogporten og tilhørende API-er kan dere automatisk oppdage og hente nye meldinger, laste ned meldinger og vedlegg maskinelt, og journalføre/arkivere direkte i eget fagsystem."}, "wg-community-05-v4-migration-steps" {:reference-answer "To make an app compatible with version 4 of the Altinn.App.* packages (which now target .Net 5): 1) Update the target framework and package dependencies in App.csproj (in the App folder), replacing the TargetFramework netcoreapp3.1 with net5.0 and updating the Altinn.App.* package references to version 4.0.0. 2) Update the Dockerfile (in the root folder) to use .Net 5 images, replacing the build image mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/sdk:3.1-alpine with mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:5.0-alpine and the runtime image mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/core/aspnet:3.1-alpine with mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspnet:5.0-alpine. 3) In Startup.cs (in the App folder), replace the many individual references to Altinn App services, Altinn Platform services, configuration-file loading, and Application Insights configuration (including the private method retrieving the Application Insights key) with two extension-method calls inside the ConfigureServices function: services.AddAppServices(Configuration, _env); and services.AddPlatformServices(Configuration, _env); where AddPlatformServices loads all configurations and services needed for Altinn Platform functionality and AddAppServices loads the remaining configurations and services such as Authorization and Prefill."}, "wg-dialog-04-app-sync-settings" {:reference-answer "The syncAdapterSettings properties (set to true to override automatic synchronization) are: disableSync (disable all dialog synchronization, overrides all other settings), disableCreate (disable creation of dialogs when app instances are created), disableDelete (disable deletion of dialogs when app instances are deleted), disableAddActivities (disable adding activities), disableAddTransmissions (disable adding transmissions), disableSyncDueAt (disable synchronizing the due at date), disableSyncStatus (disable synchronizing the status), disableSyncContentTitle (disable synchronizing the title), disableSyncContentSummary (disable synchronizing the summary), disableSyncContentAdditionalInformation (disable synchronizing the additional information), disableSyncContentExtendedStatus (disable synchronizing the extended status), disableSyncAttachments (disable synchronizing dialog attachments, only recognized IDs), disableSyncApiActions (disable synchronizing API actions, only recognized IDs), disableSyncGuiActions (disable synchronizing GUI actions, only recognized IDs), and disableMarkCompletedWhenConfirmed (disable setting dialog status to completed when app instance is ArchivedConfirmed)."}, "wg-corr-02-recipient-events" {:reference-answer "For hver mottaker publiserer Altinn Melding følgende hendelsestyper: no.altinn.correspondence.correspondencepublished (meldingen er publisert og tilgjengelig — mottaker kan hente innholdet), correspondencereceiverread (mottaker har lest meldingen — spor lesestatus), correspondencereceiverconfirmed (mottaker har bekreftet meldingen — spor bekreftelse av mottak), correspondencereceiverneverread (fristdato passert uten at mottaker leste meldingen — utløs purringer eller eskaleringsflyt) og correspondencereceiverneverconfirmed (fristdato passert uten at mottaker bekreftet meldingen — utløs purringer eller eskaleringsflyt)."}, "ue-dialog-03-unauthorized-urls" {:reference-answer "Dialogporten performs an authorization check against Altinn Authorization for each action and transmission, exposed via the `isAuthorized` flag (`true`/`false`). If `isAuthorized` is `false`, the URLs associated with that action or transmission are replaced with the special value `urn:dialogporten:unauthorized`."}}
